{"id":"b75572508eaa0da6","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-oberwolfach.md","title":"Oberwolfach 随机与相干版本变化","display":"df-oberwolfach — Oberwolfach 随机与相干版本变化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-oberwolfach","aliases":["43-df-oberwolfach"],"display":"df-oberwolfach — Oberwolfach 随机与相干版本变化","depends_on":["[[43-df-demuthtest]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Bienvenu–Greenberg–Kucera–Nies–Turetsky, Coherent randomness tests and computing the K-trivial sets, Def.2.3, PDF p.7; https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Coherent%20randomness%20tests%20and%20computing%20the%20K-trivial%20sets.pdf","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-oberwolfach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-oberwolfach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oberwolfach — Oberwolfach 随机与相干版本变化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"57783b109db5093f\" href=\"?note=57783b109db5093f\" title=\"43-df-demuthtest\">43-df-demuthtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Bienvenu–Greenberg–Kucera–Nies–Turetsky, Coherent randomness tests and computing the K-trivial sets, Def.2.3, PDF p.7; <a href=\"https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Coherent%20randomness%20tests%20and%20computing%20the%20K-trivial%20sets.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.labri.fr/perso/lbienvenu/docs/publications/Coherent randomness tests and computing the K-trivial sets.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DemuthTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{DemuthTest}\\)</span> 与最终版本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n(U,h)\">\\(F_n(U,h)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57783b109db5093f\" href=\"?note=57783b109db5093f\" title=\"43-df-demuthtest\">43-df-demuthtest</a>。相干性按整数阶段的相邻转移计数：转移索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 比较阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>；区间端点在断言中均显式量化为自然数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coherent}(h)\\iff\\forall n,a,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left(a\\le t\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a\\le s\\le t\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=h(n,a))\\right)\\Rightarrow|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:a\\le s&lt;t\\land h(n+1,s)\\ne h(n+1,s+1)\\}|\\le1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Coherent}(h)\\iff\\forall n,a,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left(a\\le t\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a\\le s\\le t\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=h(n,a))\\right)\\Rightarrow|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:a\\le s&lt;t\\land h(n+1,s)\\ne h(n+1,s+1)\\}|\\le1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\iff\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\land\\mathrm{Coherent}(h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\iff\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\land\\mathrm{Coherent}(h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OWRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n(U,h)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OWRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n(U,h)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确区分版本编号变化与开集外延相等。低层版本在一个整数阶段区间保持不变时，紧邻高层在该区间内部至多改变一次；不是要求每次高层改变都同时改变所有低层。OWRandom 保留弱 Demuth 的交集逃离条件。</p>\n<p>本轮核对既有作者稿《Coherent randomness tests and computing the K-trivial sets》Definition 2.3（PDF 页 7）及 Proposition 2.5（PDF 页 8）的相干条件与差随机蕴含。原网址及书外来源定位保留在元数据中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-demuthtest","status":"resolved","id":"57783b109db5093f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-demuthtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-demuthtest","status":"resolved","id":"57783b109db5093f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}$，$h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{DemuthTest}$ 与最终版本 $F_n(U,h)$ 见 [[43-df-demuthtest]]。相干性按整数阶段的相邻转移计数：转移索引 $s$ 比较阶段 $s$ 与 $s+1$；区间端点在断言中均显式量化为自然数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DemuthTest}","display":false},{"tex":"F_n(U,h)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coherent}(h)\\iff\\forall n,a,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\left(a\\le t\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a\\le s\\le t\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=h(n,a))\\right)\\Rightarrow|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:a\\le s<t\\land h(n+1,s)\\ne h(n+1,s+1)\\}|\\le1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\iff\\mathrm{DemuthTest}(U,h,b)\\land\\mathrm{Coherent}(h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OWRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OWTest}(U,h,b)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n(U,h)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2265,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-506","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-oberwolfach]] — Oberwolfach 随机与相干版本变化"},{"id":"d84d11f6016c87de","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-oberwolfach]]、[[43-df-diffrandom]]。"}],"outgoing":["57783b109db5093f"]}